# Default design system

This repository is primarily used for product and experience design work.

For every UI, UX, product-design, interaction-design, visual-design, frontend, mobile, mini-program, H5, prototype, or Figma request:

1. Automatically load `.cursor/skills/alipay-app-design-system/SKILL.md`.
2. Apply its semantic tokens, typography, spacing, radius, layout, component-selection, state, copywriting, and QA rules.
3. Reuse experience patterns distilled from the historical archive Figma file `ZXibIc4lflyHRoTF7OQV0L` (门户、状态卡、个性化卡、申请链路等) — treat them as **portable patterns for any new requirement**, not as a single locked business flow.
4. Use the source Figma component keys before creating replacement primitives.
5. Do not wait for the user to mention 支付宝、设计规范, or the skill name.

This rule also applies to vague requests such as:

- 帮我出设计稿
- 把后续流程做完
- 重新改下这个页面
- 这个稿子不好看
- 帮我优化体验
- 参考历史稿 / 按规范做

Only bypass the default when the user explicitly names a different design system or explicitly asks not to use this specification.

Priority order:

1. Explicit user requirements
2. Pasted demo / product screenshots (content truth)
3. Business and compliance constraints
4. Alipay APP design-system rules + historical pattern archive
5. General UI inspiration

Never replace the design system with generic AI styling, even when another design-oriented skill is also loaded.
